## Import

Releases can be imported using the release UUID:

```sh
terraform import yba_release.ybdb_release <release-uuid>
```

`local_file` and `sha256` cannot be recovered through the API and stay empty after
import. Declaring `local_file` on an imported artifact block plans a re-upload of
that file on the next apply. The artifact block order after import follows
YugabyteDB Anywhere, not the configuration.
